msgid "Classic CAN 的平台机制与接入边界"
msgstr "Classic CAN mechanisms and integration boundaries"

msgid ""
"当前公共接口是 `nexus/io/can.h`，维护 Native、STM32F407 和 GD32F470 的同一 classic CAN "
"所有权机制。两款 SoC 只有 CAN 2.0A/B：11/29-bit ID、DATA/RTR、 0–8-byte DLC；接口拒绝 CAN "
"FD、大于 8 的发送 DLC 和越界 ID。"
msgstr ""
"Public interface: `nexus/io/can.h`. Native, STM32F407 and GD32F470 maintain "
"the same classic CAN ownership mechanism. Both SoCs support only CAN 2.0A/B:"
" 11/29-bit IDs, DATA/RTR and 0–8-byte DLC. The interface rejects CAN FD, TX "
"DLC above 8 and out-of-range IDs."

msgid "静态对象与执行"
msgstr "Static objects and execution"

msgid ""
"公共 `nx_can_port_t` 只含 readonly ops 与私有 context。三个真实硬件邮箱对应 三个静态 slot，没有软件 TX "
"队列、分配器、全局可变 registry、worker 或必选 OS。 接收事件环由装配提供精确容量。未选实例不生成状态；当前生产单元的 ARM "
"objects 没有 `.data`/`.bss`，最终未选 ELF 的 GC/资源验证由实际装配构建建立。"
msgstr ""
"Public `nx_can_port_t` contains only read-only ops and private context. "
"Three physical mailboxes correspond to three static slots, without software "
"TX queues, allocators, global mutable registries, workers or mandatory OS. "
"Assembly supplies the exact receive-ring capacity. Unselected instances "
"generate no state. Current production ARM objects have no `.data`/`.bss`; "
"actual assembly builds establish final unselected-ELF GC/resource results."

msgid ""
"一个特权任务执行者序列化 submit、cancel、service、read、recover 和 stop；入口 拒绝 Handler、非特权或已有 "
"PRIMASK/BASEPRI/FAULTMASK 屏蔽状态。四条 IRQ 执行 有界邮箱/接收处理：最多三个邮箱、两个 FIFO 各三个初始帧。MCU"
" 的寄存器访问 是 direct volatile MMIO；Native 只在模型编译时替换外部寄存器/NVIC 叶端口， 生产 MCU "
"不携带模型访问表或运行时模型分支。"
msgstr ""
"One privileged task executor serializes submit, cancel, service, read, "
"recover and stop. Entries reject Handler, unprivileged or already masked "
"PRIMASK/BASEPRI/FAULTMASK contexts. Four IRQs perform bounded "
"mailbox/receive work: at most three mailboxes and three initially present "
"frames from each of two FIFOs. MCU registers use direct volatile MMIO; "
"Native replaces only external register/NVIC leaves in model builds. "
"Production MCUs carry no model-access tables or runtime-model branches."

msgid ""
"IRQ wake 是提示，不替代 request predicate。绑定时读取四条实际 IRQ priority 和 grouping，逐条验证 "
"policy/syscall ceiling；不修改全局 grouping。sink 必须 同时支持任务 service/cancel 与 IRQ "
"通知。捕获 sink 后执行者计数继续保留借用； stop、detach 或 recover 在通知尚未返回时报告 BUSY。"
msgstr ""
"IRQ wake is a hint, never a request-predicate substitute. Binding reads all "
"four actual IRQ priorities/grouping and validates each policy/syscall "
"ceiling without changing global grouping. Sinks support task service/cancel "
"and IRQ notifications. Executor counts retain the borrow after sink capture;"
" stop, detach or recover returns BUSY while notifications have not returned."

msgid "共享过滤器域与硬件事实"
msgstr "Shared filter domains and hardware facts"

msgid ""
"每个装配显式生成一个 `nx_can_filter_domain_t`，拥有主时钟、次时钟、28 个共享 filter banks、split 与 "
"immutable filter plan。无其他 controller 持有 active bit 时才允许 domain stop "
"释放时钟。STM32 CAN2 依赖 CAN1 的时钟/过滤器域；GD32 CAN1 同样依赖 CAN0。停止一个实例不 reset 主 "
"controller，也不覆盖 peer filters。"
msgstr ""
"Each assembly explicitly generates one `nx_can_filter_domain_t` owning "
"primary/secondary clocks, 28 shared filter banks, split and immutable filter"
" plan. Domain stop can release clocks only when no other controller retains "
"an active bit. STM32 CAN2 depends on CAN1 clocks/filter domain; GD32 CAN1 "
"similarly depends on CAN0. Stopping one instance neither resets the primary "
"controller nor overwrites peer filters."

